# Artifacts: core scientific outputs ARE versioned (whitelist below) so reviewers can
# read results without re-running the pipeline; bulky/operational leftovers stay local
# (reasoning_chains.json, alerts*, run_log.jsonl) — they are regenerated per run.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/MANIFEST.json
!artifacts/calibration_reliability.json
!artifacts/factor_registry.json
!artifacts/m2_per_country_comparison.csv
!artifacts/m2_refit_end_to_end.json
!artifacts/m2_window_sensitivity.json
!artifacts/m3_price_diagnostic.json
!artifacts/metrics.json
!artifacts/n4_bootstrap_ci.json
!artifacts/n6_f3_sensitivity.json
!artifacts/event_study.json
!artifacts/event_study_aligned.csv
!artifacts/country_code_map.csv
!artifacts/oos_predictions.csv
!artifacts/oos_test.csv
!artifacts/oos_val.csv
!artifacts/runtime_benchmark.json
!artifacts/shap_importance.csv
!artifacts/shap_values.csv
!artifacts/threshold_sensitivity.csv
!artifacts/threshold_sensitivity.json
!artifacts/wdi_sipri_check.json
!artifacts/xgb_model.json
!artifacts/xgb_params.json
!artifacts/figures/

# WDI snapshot data/raw_real.json IS versioned on purpose (since v2.0.0-realdata):
# the live WDI API is a moving target and drifted the fresh-clone AUC by +0.07
# (0.614 vs golden 0.5447, observed 2026-11-21). Committing the snapshot pins
# the reproducibility baseline; provenance (fetched_at) is in PROVENANCE.md.

